[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the bolt (1a) securing auxiliary driveshaft  pulley, using\nthe tool (1b) for counter-torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.765.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the auxiliary drivebelt.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021105.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the oil seal cover on the auxiliary\ndriveshaft  (1b) complete with oil seal (1c) and gasket (1d).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021106.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Working in a vice, remove oil sealing ring (1a) by fitting drift\n(1b) into the groove on the inner surface of the cover.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021107.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Fit the auxiliary driveshaft oil seal cover (1a), complete with\nnew gasket (1b), and fix it tightening the bolts (1c) to the recommended\ntorque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>AUX SHAFT SEAL COVER</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Engine crankcase side) 0.9</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021108.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Fit the new oil seal (1a), using the tool (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.882.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021109.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Refit the auxiliary drive pulley in its\nseat and secure it by tightening the bolt  to the specified torque\nusing the tool used for the dismantling for counter-torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>AUXILIARY SHAFT DRIVEN GEAR</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>8</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.765.000</p></td></tr></table></div>"]]